    {
      "id": "4B5599133D72B718",
      "title": "After MAX",
      "subtitle": "Find the anomaly first",
      "description": "[
        \"The MAX factory is still operating, but there is an additional reading in the air observation data sent by Otto that cannot be explained.\",
        \"First make the sampling and measurement equipment. After getting the real sample, you can then use experiments and research to figure it out step by step.\"
      ]",
