      "title": "Reusable spectral ampoules",
      "subtitle": "Leave a clean container for the sample",
      "description": "[
        \"Prepare the ampoule first. It contains liquid collapse energy when the sample is sealed. It will be returned in its original form after the spectrum experiment is completed, and can be used in the next batch.\"
      ]",
      "tasks": [
