      "title": "Liquid separation process",
      "subtitle": "Connect every outlet",
      "description": "[
        \"Let the initial extraction liquid, extraction liquid and consumables complete a primary fractionation. The crude liquid, mother liquor, analytical reagents and solid impurities are all used for subsequent use, and the waste extraction liquid is also stored first.\",
